# Skosh Press — Privacy Policy

**Effective Date:** October 11, 2026

Skosh Press is a desktop publishing application developed by KeyOuts. Your privacy is important, and the application is designed to work locally on your computer.

### Information Collection

Skosh Press does not collect personal information, require an account, or track how you use the software.

The application does not include advertising, analytics, or automatic crash reporting.

### Your Files and Documents

Documents, imported images, fonts, and exported publications are processed locally on your computer.

Skosh Press does not upload your documents to an external server.

You choose where to save your publications. Additional information, such as templates, printer profiles, dictionaries, and application preferences, may be stored in your computer's local application data.

### Internet Access

Skosh Press does not require an internet connection for its publishing features. The application does not include an automatic update service or cloud synchronization.

### Third-Party Services

Skosh Press does not integrate with external accounts or online publishing services.

If you choose to share or upload files created with Skosh Press using another service, that service's privacy practices will apply.

### Data Removal

You can delete your saved publications and exports directly from your computer. Some application preferences and supporting files may remain in your local application data after uninstalling the software.

### Changes to This Policy

This policy may be updated if the application's features or data-handling practices change. Any updated policy will be published alongside the software.
